<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>網站連線測試</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .card {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; }
    p { color: #444; line-height: 1.6; }
    .ok {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      background: #e8f8ee;
      color: #0a7a32;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .time { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; color: #777; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>網站連線測試</h1>
    <p>若你看得到這個頁面，代表公司電腦可以開啟此網站。</p>
    <div class="ok">連線成功</div>
    <div class="time" id="time"></div>
  </div>
  <script>
    document.getElementById("time").textContent =
      "開啟時間：" + new Date().toLocaleString();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
